i.MX8M Nano (MIMX8MN6) device headers for the Cortex-A53.

Source: zephyrproject-rtos/hal_nxp, mcux/mcux-sdk/devices/MIMX8MN6
Commit: eaffbf4ea1c272988a8a4cbe5c001ad45e0965fd
