NXP's current device repo (nxp-mcuxpresso/mcux-devices-imx) only has the Cortex-M7 header for
the 8MN. The A53 header (MIMX8MN6_ca53.h) is from the legacy MCUXpresso SDK, as kept by Zephyr.

Build with -DCPU_MIMX8MN6DVTJZ_ca53 (selects the A53 header in fsl_device_registers.h).
Unmodified.
